{"level":"debug","message":"Params: [\"cmll08gdw000nyaoegv06ck67\",\"cmlku48wi000e6pa9yrdyr6yi\",\"awdefrd\",\"sferdv\",\"Hi,\nI read your project description carefully, and it’s clear you’re not just looking for “a website” — you want a reliable, scalable online store that feels smooth for customers and is simple for you to manage. That’s exactly the kind of work I enjoy building.\n\nI specialize in custom e-commerce solutions built from the ground up, with a strong focus on clean UX, fast performance, and long-term maintainability. I usually work with Next.js and Node.js (React where needed) because this stack provides excellent SEO, secure payment integrations, scalable architecture, and clean admin dashboards. That said, I’m flexible and always choose the technology that best fits the project goals.\n\nWhat you’ll get:\n\nFully responsive storefront (desktop + mobile)\n\nProduct catalog, cart, secure checkout, and order tracking\n\nSimple admin panel for products, stock, and sales insights\n\nClean, well-documented code for easy future updates\n\nComplete deployment, domain connection, and a clear handover walkthrough\n\nI value clear communication, regular progress updates, and building products as if they were my own business.\n\nDesigner portfolios:\nhttps://sociable-teammates-259934.framer.app/\n\nhttps://sajalpatranewportfolio.framer.website/\n\nRelevant work:\nhttps://dannytailors.com\n\nhttps://www.spotyourpg.com/\n\nhttps://shravanelectrials.com\n\nhttps://siddhieshop.vercel.app\n\nhttps://preplyte.vercel.app\n\nIf you’re looking for a developer who truly cares about quality and real-world results, I’d be glad to discuss your store.\n\nKartik Vichare\n+91 7400349825\",2,0,0,0,true,\"2026-02-13 14:50:23.347 UTC\",\"2026-02-13 14:50:23.347 UTC\"]","service":"preplyte-api","timestamp":"2026-02-13 20:20:23"}
